<node id="11153825" title="Re^3: pattern matching once" created="2023-08-11 13:27:12" updated="2023-08-11 13:27:12" _doctext_mode="lenient"><type id="11">note</type>
<author id="540414">jwkrahn</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;&lt;pre&gt;
perldoc perlop

...

       "m/PATTERN/msixpodualngc"
       "/PATTERN/msixpodualngc"

...

       "m?PATTERN?msixpodualngc"
       "?PATTERN?msixpodualngc"

&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
With the // or ?? delimiters the m at the beginning is optional.
&lt;/p&gt;


